    "turn_text": "Congressman, between the Senate and the House Ag Committees, you covered a lot of territory and listened to a lot of farmers for input on this bill. There were some changes that you wanted to make in the Conservation Reserve Program, and also some changes that Senator Thune wanted to make. It turns out you both got what you were looking for.",
