    "turn_text": "well, that was a positive thing. You know, there are still some changes in the conservation area that I would have liked to done, but I was not able to get the Senate too long with it. But getting the acreage up in the CRP also changing or putting prohibitions on paying too much for it, which we've been doing and trying to get away from all of the acres going into continuous and going back to general signups. So all those things are all positive as well as the short term program. So, you know, it was like everything else. It wasn't perfect, but we did make some progress in that area.",
