    "turn_text": "Well, we'll see. I assume it will. But the purpose of this is to make sure that good farmland is not put into the CRP. And so we've now limited it on the general 85% of the rental rate. So I can guarantee you that people are not going to put good farmland into this. program, and that is what we intended from the start, but the way this thing got rolled out over the years, we were paying 250% of the rental value in a county for some of this land under the guys that were more politically correct or environmentally correct, whatever, and",
