    "turn_text": "i don't know i will will see you but i uh... so far The people that have come to me that want to be on the committee, I think, are going to be fine. They're smart, they're moderate, and they'll learn the issues. So it's a challenge not only on the committee, it's a challenge in the whole Congress and in the country because we have become so distant from agriculture and the farm that there's so few of us left that represent those kind of districts. It's just an overall problem. It's not just a problem within the committee. And so maybe one of the things we end up looking at is how can we, as a committee, do a better job of getting the rest of the country to understand what we do. And that's a challenge.",
